<title>USA: CCC buys 10,370 T of soybean oil for Peru - USDA.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 10,370 T of soybean oil for Peru - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp (CCC) of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it bought 10,370 tonnes of crude degummed soybean oil for donation to Peru.</p>
<p>The deal included 3,500 tonnes at $514.77 per tonne, 3,500 at $518.63, 2,370 at $520.29 and 1,000 at $518.07. All values are FOB and shipment is for February 3-18.</p>
<p>Cargill Inc sold the 1,000-tonne shipment and Bunge Corp sold the rest, the CCC said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
